{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisites: Dexterity 15 or higher\n\nYou have developed an aggressive combat style that espouses engaging an enemy as closely as you can, cutting them down with multiple rapid strikes. You gain the following benefits as long as you are wielding a non-Heavy melee weapon and no other weapons or shields:\n\n- When you move 20 or more feet towards a creature on your turn, you may use a bonus action to make a melee weapon attack against that creature.\n\n- Your AC increases by 1 as long as there is a hostile creature within 5 feet of you.\n\n- When a creature within 5 feet of you makes an attack against you and misses, you may use a reaction to make a weapon atack against that creature.\n\n- When a creature within 5 feet of you moves away from you, you may use a reaction to move up to your walking speed towards that creature.","level":1}],"id":"Custom43ac85aa-b1ad-4aba-a931-1b8dce2a0474","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Aggresive Melee Mastery [SM] [Revised]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}